{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rec, the civilization-recording robot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MotionRec is a recording-based puzzle action game built around the concept of recording and playback. Use this ability to guide Rec, the civilization-recording robot, through a devastated world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The power of MotionRec</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can record the trajectory of your movements, from walking to jumping. Use stage gimmicks to create and record more complex movements to traverse the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record your movements...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/8b85943624d07bed434770cde7732c38.poster.avif?t=1769052582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/8b85943624d07bed434770cde7732c38.webm?t=1769052582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/8b85943624d07bed434770cde7732c38.mp4?t=1769052582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and play them back in another location!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/26d9683b1557e9e3263178b833ee1b1e.poster.avif?t=1769052582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/26d9683b1557e9e3263178b833ee1b1e.webm?t=1769052582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/26d9683b1557e9e3263178b833ee1b1e.mp4?t=1769052582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will let you reach places too high to jump up to, or even access spots where there's nothing to stand on. You can only play back your movements a certain number of times midair, however, and this is refreshed every time you land on the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/4bceac0e40b07da74d383e3270da201a.poster.avif?t=1769052582\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/4bceac0e40b07da74d383e3270da201a.webm?t=1769052582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/extras/4bceac0e40b07da74d383e3270da201a.mp4?t=1769052582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of the MotionRec ability to unravel the mysteries behind this devastated world ruled by machines!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HANDSUM inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Artist:</strong> m7kenji</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Composer:</strong> KyoheiFujita</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer:</strong> shoma</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Forest, Awake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/af555e2d38e92a2040591b98466f8d067ebcfa29.jpg"},{"name":"Song","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/490d36eefcfd4466e388837a9c9722162fdeaeb9.jpg"},{"name":"Adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/601da020012031f70f7ba9f28c7233157568c9cd.jpg"},{"name":"Waterborne","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/8332494040c2bde3e1bc53e1a648627ada8711f2.jpg"},{"name":"Metal and Wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/33ed7dee0cfd93c544f7e274bee26f8e72b31ff5.jpg"},{"name":"Here to There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/28c30142d2595abab45426a19315a0e4f2657aaa.jpg"},{"name":"Congratulations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/0186ac5699cf4e22852fe378b2f2540b75d90eee.jpg"},{"name":"Kill Order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/4a8e2b115627f06bab026bd906f1ef2619f7e3e3.jpg"},{"name":"Rain, Alone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/c7b298ac938162a38d38b1e3cea07c8f015734b6.jpg"},{"name":"Embers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2602230/9dab4cf27bc9d5f944d5efa2517d212c8357334a.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2602230?t=1769052582","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2602230?t=1769052582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/693bf29922c3ab8771f638cdf7506fb736fa6eca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769052582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602230/693bf29922c3ab8771f638cdf7506fb736fa6eca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769052582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3738990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_